WEBVTT

00:01:34.730 --> 00:01:39.660
The entire Arima automotive research team poured their hearts and souls into this!

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:42.360
This bike absolutely cannot fall!

00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:45.490
Furthermore, so it wouldn't seem creepy to Teppei-sama,

00:01:45.490 --> 00:01:47.670
this time we added legs!

00:01:48.950 --> 00:01:50.610
That's unnecessary and disgusting!

00:02:06.630 --> 00:02:07.220
Ah!

00:02:07.450 --> 00:02:08.470
Guess who?

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:11.660
Let's see...Teppei!

00:02:11.660 --> 00:02:13.780
Huh?  How could you tell right away?

00:02:15.210 --> 00:02:16.300
I told you, didn't I?

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:18.500
"You'll know right away if it's your fated person".

00:02:19.390 --> 00:02:20.590
Just kidding!

00:02:20.770 --> 00:02:22.220
W-What's that all about?

00:02:24.420 --> 00:02:26.640
We all like Teppei.

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:29.960
Teppei will eventually come to like someone.

00:02:30.700 --> 00:02:34.190
That person might not even be one of us.

00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:39.580
Whoever Teppei chooses, no resentment or bearing grudges, okay?

00:02:40.570 --> 00:02:43.810
That's the thing that Teppei-sama dislikes the most...

00:02:44.150 --> 00:02:47.340
Perhaps he would prefer someone who acts ladylike?

00:02:47.340 --> 00:02:50.830
By "ladylike", do you mean an older woman?  I don't think that's it...

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:53.310
Then, let's make a "Hot Spring Pact"!

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:03.900
I have received notification.

00:03:04.380 --> 00:03:06.990
When the Princess cannot be found...

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:09.060
It's obvious who to blame!

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:13.620
In order to protect the Princess from an obnoxious insect like you,

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:17.040
I, Alf, am prepared to put my life on the line!

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:18.700
Don't call him an obnoxious insect!

00:03:19.140 --> 00:03:21.080
Teppei is my beloved!

00:03:21.710 --> 00:03:22.890
Beloved!

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:24.390
Beloved!

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:25.710
Beloved!

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:28.930
"Beloved", you say?!

00:03:29.420 --> 00:03:30.080
That's right.

00:03:30.930 --> 00:03:36.060
Milady, I believe I am somehow misunderstanding you...

00:03:36.340 --> 00:03:37.660
It's not a misunderstanding!

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:40.220
Beloved is beloved, right Teppei?

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:45.690
As if I could forgive one who is taking advantage of Milady's purity!

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:49.950
Wait a second!  Nobody's trying to take advantage of Charl here!

00:03:50.810 --> 00:03:52.360
Silence, you...

00:03:53.070 --> 00:03:55.160
...stray dog!

00:03:56.800 --> 00:03:57.830
Shall we run away, Teppei?

00:03:58.030 --> 00:03:58.960
Y-Yeah!

00:03:59.870 --> 00:04:01.220
Hold it!

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:06.220
Milady, ever since you were born,

00:04:06.730 --> 00:04:09.280
I have continued to watch over you.

00:04:09.820 --> 00:04:14.210
Until the day comes that the light of life is gone from my eyes,

00:04:14.210 --> 00:04:15.560
Milady...

00:04:15.590 --> 00:04:16.890
M-Milady...

00:04:22.020 --> 00:04:23.310
I think we should be safe now.

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:25.160
Thank goodness.

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:27.940
Sheesh, he's so persistent.

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:30.950
Judging by that, he'll live to be a hundred.

00:04:31.490 --> 00:04:33.940
I'll bet a hundred and twenty.

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:37.970
"Please be healthy until my daughter is ready to enter politics."

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:42.830
Do you want to pass some time out here?

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:43.760
Yeah.

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:46.290
What's wrong?

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:50.140
It's nothing, I think I twisted my ankle a little.

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:53.210
Ah, sorry.  Was it because I was pulling you along?

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:55.580
No, it's not your fault.

00:04:56.930 --> 00:04:57.390
Ah!

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:01.890
Let's go to the infirmary.

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:03.490
Teppei?

00:05:04.690 --> 00:05:05.860
I'm really sorry.

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:10.150
It's not your fault.

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:14.340
Arima Hills...

00:05:14.340 --> 00:05:14.870
Hm?

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:19.120
I've always wanted to try eating at Arima Hills.

00:05:19.390 --> 00:05:20.970
Eating at "Arima Hills"?

00:05:21.230 --> 00:05:22.100
That's right.

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:24.400
If you invite me, we'll call it even about my leg.

00:05:24.570 --> 00:05:25.230
Okay?

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:26.380
I got it.

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:33.510
This should do it.

00:05:34.040 --> 00:05:36.230
Just be careful, and it'll heal quickly.

00:05:39.300 --> 00:05:39.930
What...?

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:06.600
A parachutist?

00:06:06.860 --> 00:06:07.980
I wonder who this is...

00:06:08.390 --> 00:06:09.100
Let's go.

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:24.370
It must be fate.

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:38.700
Hey!  Students of Shuuhou Academy!

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:40.570
I thank you for coming to greet me.

00:06:41.870 --> 00:06:43.990
It's not like we came out just to greet him...

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:46.160
Hartman Vezelheim.

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:48.000
Silvie, you know him?

00:06:48.710 --> 00:06:49.460
Hartman?

00:06:49.990 --> 00:06:50.400
Yes.

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:53.790
He's a businessman from the Hazelrink Principality.

00:06:54.170 --> 00:06:56.780
Hazelrink?  You mean Charlotte's country?

00:06:57.650 --> 00:06:58.670
Charlotte!

00:06:59.360 --> 00:07:00.100
Hartman.

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:08.360
They seem to know each other.

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:09.460
That's right.

00:07:10.050 --> 00:07:11.480
He has ties with royalty.

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:14.030
I thought I had heard of him.

00:07:14.850 --> 00:07:16.560
Hartman Vezelheim.

00:07:16.890 --> 00:07:18.960
He trades with the Arima Group.

00:07:16.890 --> 00:07:18.960
It's a pleasure to meet you all.

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:20.460
Is that so?

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:25.450
Vezelheim-sama currently has large investments with the Arima Group.

00:07:26.410 --> 00:07:28.220
You must be Arima Teppei-kun, right?

00:07:29.140 --> 00:07:30.670
How do you know about me?

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:32.330
Of course I know about you.

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:35.260
The designated heir to the Arima Group.

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:41.180
It also seems you get along very well with Charlotte.

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:42.330
Yeah.

00:07:42.330 --> 00:07:43.120
Hartman.

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:46.110
From the looks of it, you don't know who I am.

00:07:46.980 --> 00:07:48.660
I'm her fiancé.

00:07:49.630 --> 00:07:51.750
Charlotte Hazelrink's, that is.

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:07.600
Miss Houjouin, I thank you for showing me around campus.

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:11.400
I am happy that I was able to see where my fiancée studies at.

00:08:12.060 --> 00:08:14.230
No, it was nothing.

00:08:14.620 --> 00:08:16.580
I'll be in this country for quite a while.

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:19.030
Arima Teppei-kun.

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:21.250
I'm sure we will meet again.

00:08:21.940 --> 00:08:24.930
I look forward to discussing many important matters with Arima Isshin-san.

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:27.060
I see.

00:08:29.140 --> 00:08:30.480
Well then, Charlotte.

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:38.910
I will come again.

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:46.620
Charl.

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:51.000
I didn't know about you having a fiancé.

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:57.260
I'm sorry...I don't want to talk about that right now.

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:09.390
Charl, we were talking about dinner?

00:09:11.370 --> 00:09:15.810
In the Arima Hills suite room, they can prepare whatever you'd like!

00:09:16.060 --> 00:09:17.440
Teppei!

00:09:18.210 --> 00:09:20.690
When?  When will you take me?

00:09:21.710 --> 00:09:22.530
I'll let you know.

00:09:23.780 --> 00:09:24.770
I'll be waiting!

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:26.890
I'll always be waiting!

00:09:29.980 --> 00:09:31.360
"Hot Spring Pact"!

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:33.650
That's not what I was thinking...

00:09:35.060 --> 00:09:36.440
I get it, I get it.

00:09:55.350 --> 00:09:56.170
What's the meaning of this?

00:09:57.800 --> 00:10:00.840
If that's true, Fil'mish will be in a state of confusion.

00:10:01.610 --> 00:10:02.630
That's far from it.

00:10:02.980 --> 00:10:04.770
It wouldn't be that unthinkable for the country to disappear!

00:10:05.770 --> 00:10:07.230
You're certain this is reliable information, right?

00:10:07.940 --> 00:10:09.900
Does Hazelrink know of this?

00:10:10.770 --> 00:10:11.940
Onee-chan?

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:14.110
Maria.

00:10:14.950 --> 00:10:16.830
What is it?  An argument?

00:10:22.230 --> 00:10:23.220
Don't tell me...

00:10:23.830 --> 00:10:24.750
That's...

00:10:43.920 --> 00:10:44.850
Yoo-hoo!

00:10:46.980 --> 00:10:48.920
Huh?  Just you, Silvie?

00:10:49.560 --> 00:10:50.920
Yes.  Just me.

00:10:51.780 --> 00:10:52.750
I see.

00:10:55.430 --> 00:10:57.090
Don't you have something to tell me?

00:10:57.850 --> 00:10:58.330
Eh?

00:10:59.100 --> 00:11:01.550
I'm asking you, don't you have something to say?

00:11:02.520 --> 00:11:03.570
About what?

00:11:04.520 --> 00:11:09.700
Hmm...this morning, I had scrambled eggs and a croissant!

00:11:09.900 --> 00:11:11.340
I'm not talking about your breakfast!

00:11:14.390 --> 00:11:15.740
Is it about Hartman?

00:11:18.930 --> 00:11:20.920
I'm sorry I kept quiet about it.

00:11:22.020 --> 00:11:22.920
That's it?

00:11:23.150 --> 00:11:23.480
Eh?

00:11:25.110 --> 00:11:27.100
I don't really care about Hartman.

00:11:27.990 --> 00:11:30.830
Although I was surprised, I know things like that often happen in this world.

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:32.210
More importantly...

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:36.160
Were you aware that the Hazelrink Principality, as well as my home country, the Fil'mish Principality,

00:11:36.620 --> 00:11:39.660
have been secretly constructing nuclear missile silos?

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:43.000
What's that?

00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:46.090
My father didn't know anything about it.

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:48.740
What about Hazelrink?

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:51.000
There's no way I would know!

00:11:51.860 --> 00:11:52.670
Is that the truth?

00:11:53.030 --> 00:11:57.010
Of course!  I don't think my father knows, either...

00:11:57.620 --> 00:12:01.960
According to my father's conversation, this was probably instigated by a third country.

00:12:01.960 --> 00:12:03.340
Which country is that?

00:12:04.540 --> 00:12:06.170
We don't know, that's the problem.

00:12:06.840 --> 00:12:08.190
We don't know their objective, either.

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:12.860
Perhaps they intend to destroy the alliance between our nations.

00:12:13.420 --> 00:12:16.490
It might be something else, entirely.

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:20.690
I don't appreciate you eavesdropping.

00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:25.590
Houjouin.

00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:28.860
It was kind of hard to find a place to interrupt.

00:12:29.630 --> 00:12:31.380
I've heard everything, in the end.

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:34.040
I guess there's nothing we can do about it.

00:12:34.630 --> 00:12:37.510
I know.  I don't intend to tell anyone.

00:12:38.510 --> 00:12:41.010
You can never be sure who's watching.

00:12:41.670 --> 00:12:43.100
I feel...kind of frightened.

00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:49.300
I have some information from my uncle, so I have a secret to tell too.

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:52.110
I'll tell you as an apology for listening in.

00:12:54.970 --> 00:12:57.290
Even though it might be unreliable information,

00:12:57.620 --> 00:13:02.860
there's a tabloid saying that something is going to happen at Arima Hills tonight.

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:04.490
What's their objective?

00:13:04.870 --> 00:13:06.100
As to that, I have no idea.

00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:08.780
Still, I have a bad feeling about this.

00:13:08.980 --> 00:13:13.130
Jeez, what're you talking about?  Stop saying strange things!

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:25.670
Teppei?

00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:29.750
That's right...if it's Teppei...

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:32.660
If it's Teppei, I'm sure he can do something about it.

00:13:45.350 --> 00:13:50.910
Teppei-sama, you can reach room service by dialing extension seven from your room phone,

00:13:50.910 --> 00:13:54.180
rather than coming to the front desk.

00:13:54.840 --> 00:13:55.990
Ah, is that so?

00:13:56.240 --> 00:13:56.730
Yes.

00:13:57.090 --> 00:14:02.680
I still can't get used to that sort of thing, just using the phone for everything.

00:14:03.210 --> 00:14:06.020
Isn't it better to meet and talk face-to-face like this?

00:14:06.300 --> 00:14:08.810
If that would be all right with you, Teppei-sama.

00:14:09.440 --> 00:14:11.790
Then, when would you like them to come by?

00:14:13.170 --> 00:14:16.360
More importantly, I'd prefer Japanese cuisine...

00:14:16.890 --> 00:14:20.800
Hmm?  Well, if it isn't Arima Teppei-kun.

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:24.240
Josephine, could you wait for me a moment?

00:14:24.570 --> 00:14:27.640
We have the menu.  Please wait just a moment.

00:14:27.920 --> 00:14:28.500
Thank you.

00:14:29.860 --> 00:14:31.210
Arima Teppei-kun.

00:14:33.910 --> 00:14:35.140
Y-You're...

00:14:36.110 --> 00:14:37.740
Please, call me Hartman.

00:14:39.990 --> 00:14:41.770
Making a reservation for a date?

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:44.710
Ah, no, it's not a date...

00:14:45.240 --> 00:14:46.930
I'm just getting home.

00:14:50.020 --> 00:14:52.670
Ah, that's right, this place is also your house.

00:14:53.360 --> 00:14:54.640
Do you have business with Grandfather?

00:14:54.970 --> 00:14:58.800
Pretty much.  I thought I'd say hello, since I spotted you.

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:00.430
Did I disturb you?

00:15:00.810 --> 00:15:02.360
Ah, not at all.

00:15:03.030 --> 00:15:04.490
Well then, please excuse me.

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:07.730
I wish for your date to be successful.

00:15:08.030 --> 00:15:09.370
Like I said, it's not a date...

00:15:13.880 --> 00:15:14.750
Teppei-sama?

00:15:15.840 --> 00:15:17.040
Ah, sorry, sorry.

00:15:18.190 --> 00:15:19.210
Did you find the menu?

00:15:20.460 --> 00:15:22.430
What's Teppei doing?

00:15:23.830 --> 00:15:24.380
Ah!

00:15:25.850 --> 00:15:28.350
I'll be waiting in the suite in one hour.

00:15:29.930 --> 00:15:31.410
Hooray!

00:15:36.920 --> 00:15:38.020
Sorry for the wait.

00:15:39.760 --> 00:15:42.360
I sincerely apologize for taking up your time.

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:45.680
Josephine, would you mind leaving us?

00:15:49.910 --> 00:15:52.820
Well then, please allow me to start the conversation.

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:56.470
Ah, I'm sorry.  Can you wait for just a little while?

00:15:57.670 --> 00:15:59.960
There's one more person that will join us.

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:01.350
One more?

00:16:03.770 --> 00:16:05.180
Ah, it seems he's here.

00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:06.710
Enter!

00:16:10.970 --> 00:16:15.440
Do you know him?  This is Sir Vincent van Hossen of the Fil'mish Principality.

00:16:16.480 --> 00:16:21.280
For this meeting, he will act as Fil'mish's representative.

00:16:23.070 --> 00:16:24.520
This is the first time we've had the pleasure of meeting.

00:16:25.030 --> 00:16:26.790
I've heard rumors about you.

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:29.470
Hazelrink's premier businessman,

00:16:30.030 --> 00:16:32.370
as well as Princess Charlotte's fiancé.

00:16:33.330 --> 00:16:35.140
It's only a matter of time before you become royalty.

00:16:37.130 --> 00:16:38.660
Well then, shall we begin?

00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:47.720
The matter at hand is the cooperative agreement between Hazelrink, Fil'mish, and the Arima Group.

00:16:48.280 --> 00:16:52.420
The original plan was to build a large resort in the neighboring territory, correct?

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:53.380
Yes.

00:16:54.180 --> 00:16:59.150
Even so, a close aide of mine conspired with a third country.

00:16:59.510 --> 00:17:01.320
What is this third country?

00:17:01.910 --> 00:17:04.280
He would not admit who he was working for.

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:07.320
Putting his own life on the line?

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:10.180
Or making excuses?

00:17:10.180 --> 00:17:10.510
Yes.

00:17:11.890 --> 00:17:14.920
Their objective is to build nuclear weapons in the countryside near the resort.

00:17:15.450 --> 00:17:20.490
As a result, they intend to destroy the friendly relationship between the two countries.

00:17:21.410 --> 00:17:27.710
As the person responsible and Princess Charlotte's fiancé, are you investigating it?

00:17:28.090 --> 00:17:32.510
They first seek to sow the seeds of suspicion in Fil'mish.

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:33.480
That's correct.

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:37.710
Then make people think that Hazelrink is continuing to build up their military.

00:17:38.350 --> 00:17:39.420
That's sheer idiocy.

00:17:40.110 --> 00:17:42.310
There are limits to how foolish they can make us appear.

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:45.600
Actually, this plan would only deceive a child.

00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:52.200
But, you are also responsible for allowing those people to have their way or not,

00:17:52.360 --> 00:17:53.150
Hartman.

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:55.910
Yes.  I am fully aware of that.

00:17:56.500 --> 00:18:01.580
By way of apology, the investigation is already well underway.

00:18:02.320 --> 00:18:06.550
You are honest and easy to deceive.  Be careful.

00:18:07.240 --> 00:18:12.720
By possessing money and power, you are always one step away from danger.

00:18:13.060 --> 00:18:14.410
Do not forget that.

00:18:15.720 --> 00:18:16.120
Yes.

00:18:18.570 --> 00:18:19.620
Milady!

00:18:20.130 --> 00:18:21.600
Milady, where are you?

00:18:24.010 --> 00:18:24.950
Take me to Arima Hills.

00:18:25.230 --> 00:18:26.100
Yes, ma'am.

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:28.230
Ah, Milady!

00:18:29.550 --> 00:18:30.150
Hurry!

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:33.250
Milady!

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:34.240
Hurry up and drive!

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:35.440
I-Is that okay?

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:36.510
It's fine!

00:18:39.860 --> 00:18:42.920
M-Milady!

00:18:43.920 --> 00:18:44.780
If it's Teppei...

00:18:45.370 --> 00:18:47.180
If it's Teppei, he'll be able to do something about it!

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:55.370
First, we'll need to be certain we can trust all Arima Group personnel from Japan.

00:18:56.910 --> 00:19:01.300
Do you suspect that someone from the Group is behind this?

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:05.350
I would like to hear Sir van Hossen's opinion as well.

00:19:06.270 --> 00:19:08.520
My opinion is of no matter.

00:19:09.130 --> 00:19:15.660
More importantly, if the citizens of either Fil'mish or Hazelrink hear of this, public unrest will occur.

00:19:16.430 --> 00:19:20.200
I had plans to prevent the media from spreading this information.

00:19:21.330 --> 00:19:22.760
It was leaked, huh?

00:19:23.550 --> 00:19:25.740
You can only suppress information for so long.

00:19:27.730 --> 00:19:29.190
Maria, where is Father?

00:19:30.030 --> 00:19:32.280
Papa said he was going to Grandpa's building.

00:19:32.990 --> 00:19:33.990
He's at Arima Hills?

00:19:34.470 --> 00:19:38.530
Then he said that Onee-chan should go to Onii-chan's place.

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:40.420
To Teppei-dono's place?

00:19:50.220 --> 00:19:52.460
Hmm...the one on the right?

00:19:53.510 --> 00:19:55.480
Show it to me with those tights from before, okay?

00:19:58.870 --> 00:19:59.740
Thank you.

00:20:00.860 --> 00:20:03.640
Just standing by and watching wouldn't do my name justice.

00:20:17.990 --> 00:20:19.160
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:20:19.240 --> 00:20:20.230
H-Huh?

00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:26.790
Teppei?

00:20:31.260 --> 00:20:31.660
Hmm?

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:34.860
Teppei-sama, you have a phone call.

00:20:35.340 --> 00:20:37.790
Oh crap, I forgot I had it set to vibrate.

00:20:41.410 --> 00:20:42.080
Charl?

00:20:57.290 --> 00:20:57.470
Ah!

00:21:17.550 --> 00:21:18.520
She's not answering...

00:23:25.380 --> 00:23:28.410
Question!  What would you recommend as a souvenir from Arima Hills?

00:23:28.410 --> 00:23:30.350
I recommend the Arima meat bun with extra legs, that moves!

00:23:30.350 --> 00:23:32.090
Perhaps a ceramic vase, that moves!

00:23:32.090 --> 00:23:33.160
Ah, it's creeping me out!

00:23:33.160 --> 00:23:33.880
Ah, it's moving!

00:23:33.880 --> 00:23:34.800
You've eaten the whole thing already?

00:23:34.800 --> 00:23:36.800
Next time, on Princess Lover!

00:23:36.800 --> 00:23:37.840
"Paradise and Reality!"

00:23:37.840 --> 00:23:39.840
You have bad manners!
